      "content": "but it's not just a feeling. i know what i am. i did something that actually changed people's lives for the worse. i can't just \"talk it out\" with a therapist like it's some misunderstanding. it's a fact. i'm just a burden to everyone who has to deal with me. don't you see how much easier things would be if i just wasn't around to mess things up?",
