      "content": "Those feelings of isolation and the belief that removing yourself would bring peace are incredibly painful, but please know that people often speak kindly to offer support even when they are deeply hurting alongside you. Choosing peace by taking your own life never works out logically, as it permanently destroys lives that could still love and heal with you. I am so sorry you are struggling this much, and I strongly urge you to speak with a mental health professional who can listen without judgment and help you find clarity and safety.",
